# Normalize line endings to LF for text files. The CI layout check parses
# SKILL.md frontmatter with `text.startswith('---\n')`, so SKILL.md being
# checked in with CRLF (which Windows + core.autocrlf=true would do) would
# break validation on Linux runners.
*           text=auto eol=lf
*.md        text eol=lf
*.yaml      text eol=lf
*.yml       text eol=lf
*.json      text eol=lf
*.py        text eol=lf
LICENSE     text eol=lf
.gitignore  text eol=lf
